    <!-- ═══════════ 4. THE MYINSURANCEBRO EXPERIENCE ═══════════ -->
    <section class="section-padding" id="how-it-works">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="section-header fade-up">
          <h2>The <span class="highlight">Myinsurancebro</span> Experience</h2>
          <p>From choosing the right plan to lifetime claim support — we're with you at every step.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="bento stagger">
          <div class="bento-item wide ink">
            <span class="icon-tile"><svg class="icon"><use href="#i-target"></use></svg></span>
            <h3>We start with what you actually need</h3>
            <p>Before any plan gets mentioned, we work out your real cover requirement — income, liabilities,
              dependants, existing group cover and what your parents already have. Half the people who come to us need
              less cover than they were about to buy.</p>
          </div>

          <div class="bento-item">
            <span class="icon-tile teal"><svg class="icon"><use href="#i-scale"></use></svg></span>
            <h3>Compared on numbers, not brochures</h3>
            <p>Settlement ratios, complaint volumes and waiting periods — the figures that decide a claim.</p>
          </div>

          <div class="bento-item">
            <span class="icon-tile warm"><svg class="icon"><use href="#i-file-text"></use></svg></span>
            <h3>Policy wording in plain English</h3>
            <p>We read the exclusions out loud before you buy, so nothing is a surprise at claim time.</p>
          </div>

          <div class="bento-item wide">
            <span class="icon-tile danger"><svg class="icon"><use href="#i-life-buoy"></use></svg></span>
            <h3>Lifetime claim support — including on policies you bought elsewhere</h3>
            <p>Filing a claim is the worst possible time to be figuring out paperwork alone. We handle documentation,
              pre-authorisation and insurer follow-ups, and escalate to the Ombudsman if a rejection does not hold up.
              This applies even if you never bought anything from us.</p>
            <div class="experience-card-links" style="margin-top:var(--space-4)">
              <a href="#claim-support">How claim support works <span class="arrow">→</span></a>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="bento-item">
            <span class="icon-tile"><svg class="icon"><use href="#i-lock"></use></svg></span>
            <h3>Zero spam, ever</h3>
            <p>Your number is not a lead to be resold. One advisor, and only when you ask.</p>
          </div>

          <div class="bento-item">
            <span class="icon-tile teal"><svg class="icon"><use href="#i-wallet"></use></svg></span>
            <h3>Free, and it stays free</h3>
            <p>Insurers pay our commission. You pay the same premium either way — you just get an advisor with it.</p>
          </div>

          <div class="bento-item wide">
            <span class="icon-tile warm"><svg class="icon"><use href="#i-calendar"></use></svg></span>
            <h3>We check in at renewal, not just at the sale</h3>
            <p>Cover needs change when you marry, have a child, take a home loan or your parents cross 60. We revisit
              the file at every renewal instead of letting it quietly go stale.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
